#: ../../openmvcam/shields/wireless-tv-shield.rst:2
#: ../../openmvcam/shields/wireless-tv-shield.rst:6
msgid "Wireless TV Shield"
msgstr "Kablosuz TV Shield"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/wireless-tv-shield.rst:4
msgid ""
"The Wireless TV Shield combines a VS23S010 SPI-to-NTSC video generator with "
"an MM213TL 5.8 GHz analog video transmitter so the OpenMV Cam can broadcast "
"its frames to an FPV receiver."
msgstr ""
"Kablosuz TV Shield, bir VS23S010 SPI-NTSC video üretecini bir MM213TL 5,8 "
"GHz analog video vericisiyle birleştirir; böylece OpenMV Cam çerçevelerini "
"bir FPV alıcısına yayınlayabilir."

